OL,3,ASenior Kazakh officials detained after
OL,4,A14 service members swept out to sea
OL,5,
OL,6,FFive senior military officials have
OL,7,Fbeen detained in Kazakhstan following
OL,8,Fthe death of 14 service members who
OL,9,Fwere taking part in military exercises.
OL,11,FThose who died were among a total of 17
OL,12,Fwho were swept into the Caspian Sea as
OL,13,Fthey were disembarking from a boat on
OL,14,FThursday. Officials say the incident
OL,15,Foccurred "during a combat training
OL,16,Fmission due to a sharp deterioration in
OL,17,Fmeteorological conditions and
OL,18,Fincreasing winds".
OL,20,FThree were rescued.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
