OL,3,ASenior Kazakh officials detained after
OL,4,A14 service members swept out to sea
OL,5,
OL,6,FThose detained include the chief of
OL,7,Fstaff and first deputy commander of
OL,8,FKazakhstan's Naval Forces, two military
OL,9,Funit commanders, and the commanders of
OL,10,Fa marine company and a boat. They are
OL,11,Fsuspected of criminal negligence.
